    splashText = "COMMON INSTRUCTIONS\nCreate one textless 1920x1080 Memoriam splash concept sampler for Rashid-1, divided into four exactly equal 16:9 quads in a clean 2x2 grid: A top-left, B top-right, C bottom-left, D bottom-right. Use a narrow neutral-black cross-shaped gutter. Each quad is one independent frozen instant; figures, architecture, smoke, and lighting remain inside that quad.\n\nREFERENCE INPUTS — Attach every named file as an actual generation input. Use `assets/references/style-references/general-style-reference-contact-sheet.png` only for cinematic gothic-noir realism, near-monochrome black and charcoal, hard contrast, deep negative space, wet or metallic highlights, layered atmosphere, dynamic composition, and restrained blood-red accents; do not borrow its subjects or locations. Use `assets/references/pc-character-references/Rashid Abdulrahman [Cutout].webp` as Rashid’s exact identity reference. Also use `assets/references/npc-character-references/Laleh bint Saif [Cutout].webp` as Laleh bint Saif’s exact identity reference. Preserve each named figure’s face, apparent age, build, complexion, hair, and distinguishing features while adapting clothing and grooming to 1774–1811. Character identity references override the style reference.\n\nCHARACTER AND PERIOD — Set every quad within 1774–1811, Diriyah in the First Saudi State. Rashid is mortal throughout this period: render him recognizably younger where appropriate, allow natural aging across the decades, and give him healthy mortal coloration without fangs or the blackened ring. Laleh is an ancient vampire with uniformly supernatural light-absorbing black skin, not a mortal brown complexion, and appears only at night in Quad D.  Architecture, clothing, weapons, manuscripts, transport, institutions, and religious practice must suit the specific decade and geography.\n\nSUPERNATURAL LANGUAGE — Ur-Shulgi’s Promise is a blackened ring and finger on Rashid’s hand, glowing restrained deep red only under supernatural pressure. Blood Sorcery appears as disciplined geometric skeins, incomplete calligraphic structures without readable words, or seals of deep-red light. Ancestral blood memory appears as one coherent scene inside a red-black threshold, never purple smoke or generic fantasy beams.\n\nCAMERA AND STYLE — Describe only one camera-visible instant per quad. Give each featured figure one principal pose, a clear expression, and a simple readable eyeline. Explore useful low, high, over-the-shoulder, or architectural viewpoints without obscuring anatomy. Reserve a calm dark low-detail area in every quad for later overlay text. No montage within a quad, captions, labels, readable manuscripts, logos, extra borders, watermark, anachronisms, static lineup posing, or graphic gore.\n\nQUAD A — TOP LEFT\nIn strong daytime sunlight, young mortal Rashid is kneeling in a palm-shaded mud-brick courtyard beside an open wooden chest, placing a devotional manuscript inside while an older Sufi teacher is lowering the lid. Rashid’s face is turned toward the open gate, brows knitted and lips closed in wary concentration. Beyond the gate, two reformist patrolmen are crossing the sunlit lane without looking into the courtyard. A well, woven mats, family rooms, palms, and hard blue sky make the daylight unmistakable. Use an elevated viewpoint from the courtyard wall.\n\nQUAD B — TOP RIGHT\nIn Diriyah’s busy daytime souq, adult mortal Rashid is pressing one hand down on a merchant’s false balance scale while pointing with the other toward correctly weighed grain sacks beside a waiting family. His eyes are fixed on a defensive caravan official, mouth set in controlled accusation. Merchants, jurists, soldiers, and tribal envoys are crowding the awning shade around them. Sunlit mud-brick lanes, pack animals, dates, grain, and oasis palms establish ordinary state administration. Camera low beside the scale weights.\n\nQUAD C — BOTTOM LEFT\nInside a formal study hall lit by late-afternoon daylight through high screened windows, mortal Rashid is standing beside a low table and pointing to one marked location on a campaign map without readable text. His expression is grave and imploring. A reformist jurist across from him is leaning forward with one raised finger, while a Sufi elder beside Rashid is watching the map with folded hands. Two recruiters are waiting at the doorway. Keep the three-sided disagreement physically clear and restrained. Use a side-on camera at table height.\n\nQUAD D — BOTTOM RIGHT\nAt a moonlit caravan yard at night near the end of Rashid’s mortal life, Laleh bint Saif is extending a small coded metal token across the space between them. Her uncovered skin is uniformly supernatural, light-absorbing black, and her expression is unreadably calm. Rashid is holding the token’s opposite edge and looking down at its engraving with narrowed curiosity. Officials and arriving envoys remain far behind them. Lanterns, camel tack, stacked cargo, and deep night sky frame the private recruitment. Use a close three-quarter camera with their joined object centered and clear personal space between them.",
