    splashText = "COMMON INSTRUCTIONS\nCreate one textless 1920x1080 Memoriam splash concept sampler for Rashid-9, divided into four exactly equal 16:9 quads in a clean 2x2 grid: A top-left, B top-right, C bottom-left, D bottom-right. Use a narrow neutral-black cross-shaped gutter. Each quad is one independent frozen instant; figures, architecture, smoke, and lighting remain inside that quad.\n\nREFERENCE INPUTS — Attach every named file as an actual generation input. Use `assets/references/style-references/general-style-reference-contact-sheet.png` only for cinematic gothic-noir realism, near-monochrome black and charcoal, hard contrast, deep negative space, wet or metallic highlights, layered atmosphere, dynamic composition, and restrained blood-red accents; do not borrow its subjects or locations. Use `assets/references/pc-character-references/Rashid Abdulrahman [Cutout].webp` as Rashid’s exact identity reference. Also use `assets/references/npc-character-references/Sofia Mavridi [Cutout].webp` as Sofia Mavridi’s exact identity reference. Preserve each named figure’s face, apparent age, build, complexion, hair, and distinguishing features while adapting clothing and grooming to 1839–1893. Character identity references override the style reference.\n\nCHARACTER AND PERIOD — Set every quad within 1839–1893, Constantinople in the Ottoman Empire. Rashid and Sofia are ageless vampires. Every quad is set unmistakably at night or inside a fully enclosed sunless room. Their partnership is intellectual and practical rather than romantic.  Architecture, clothing, weapons, manuscripts, transport, institutions, and religious practice must suit the specific decade and geography.\n\nSUPERNATURAL LANGUAGE — Ur-Shulgi’s Promise is a blackened ring and finger on Rashid’s hand, glowing restrained deep red only under supernatural pressure. Blood Sorcery appears as disciplined geometric skeins, incomplete calligraphic structures without readable words, or seals of deep-red light. Ancestral blood memory appears as one coherent scene inside a red-black threshold, never purple smoke or generic fantasy beams.\n\nCAMERA AND STYLE — Describe only one camera-visible instant per quad. Give each featured figure one principal pose, a clear expression, and a simple readable eyeline. Explore useful low, high, over-the-shoulder, or architectural viewpoints without obscuring anatomy. Reserve a calm dark low-detail area in every quad for later overlay text. No montage within a quad, captions, labels, readable manuscripts, logos, extra borders, watermark, anachronisms, static lineup posing, or graphic gore.\n\nQUAD A — TOP LEFT\nAt night inside a manuscript shop near the Bosphorus, Rashid and Sofia Mavridi are gripping opposite edges of the same damaged codex above a cluttered counter. Sofia’s chin is raised, eyes fixed challengingly on Rashid; Rashid is pointing with his blackened ringed finger toward a sketched architectural fragment on the open page while meeting her gaze. Oil lamps illuminate their faces; beyond the window only moonlight, dark water, and scattered ferry lanterns are visible. Scholars and servants are browsing in the background. Camera low beside the codex.\n\nQUAD B — TOP RIGHT\nInside their windowless Nephilim library at night, Rashid is extending reform-era permits toward a police investigator across a desk, his expression calm and unreadable. Sofia is standing at a closed false bookshelf several paces behind him with one hand covering its hidden latch, watching the investigator. Scribes are seated quietly around harmless records while censored books remain out of sight. Oil lamps, carved wooden walls, icons, Islamic manuscripts, maps, and archaeological fragments create a shared research household. Use an over-the-shoulder view from behind the investigator.\n\nQUAD C — BOTTOM LEFT\nAt a gaslit ministry salon at night during the Tanzimat era, Rashid is sliding one compromise document into the empty center of a long table while Sofia is turning one reluctant delegate’s chair toward the opposing side. Rashid is watching the jurist opposite him with focused patience; Sofia is looking at the delegate she is redirecting. Sufis, diplomats, artists, jurists, and pale Kindred wear mixed Ottoman and European evening dress beneath chandeliers. Tall windows show only black night and city lamps. Use a high three-quarter view that clarifies the table geometry.\n\nQUAD D — BOTTOM RIGHT\nDuring a major urban fire at night, Rashid is seated at a telegraph desk decoding one intercepted strip while Sofia is standing at an open doorway and pointing firefighters toward a threatened archive across the street. Rashid’s eyes are fixed on the code; Sofia’s expression is urgent and commanding. Servants are carrying boxed books past them in one organized line. Flames provide restrained red accents beyond the windows; telegraph wires, gaslit avenues, and steam-ferry lights show the city modernizing. Use a restrained Dutch angle from beside the telegraph key.",
