    splashText = "COMMON INSTRUCTIONS\nCreate one textless 1920x1080 Memoriam splash concept sampler for Rashid-13, divided into four exactly equal 16:9 quads in a clean 2x2 grid: A top-left, B top-right, C bottom-left, D bottom-right. Use a narrow neutral-black cross-shaped gutter. Each quad is one independent frozen instant; figures, architecture, supernatural effects, and lighting remain inside that quad.\n\nREFERENCE INPUTS — Attach every named file as an actual generation input. Use `assets/references/composition-references/Rashid-13 Modified Sampler.jpg` as the governing edit target and exact composition reference: preserve its four scenes, framing, figure placement, scale, atmosphere, Panel A composite, and Rashid’s pose and eyeline in Panel B. Use `assets/references/pc-character-references/Rashid Abdulrahman [Cutout].webp` as Rashid’s exact identity reference and `assets/references/npc-character-references/Sofia Mavridi [Cutout].webp` as Sofia Mavridi’s exact identity reference. Use `assets/output/concept-art/michael-the-archangel-beckoning-visual-language-sampler.png` as Michael’s governing appearance and radiance reference: preserve his impossibly youthful, soft-featured, innocent face; flowing pale blond hair; bare alabaster-pale vampiric torso; narrow blood-red drape; blazing white-blue eyes; and overwhelming actinic lunar glory. Use `assets/references/pc-character-references/Rashid (Ur-Shulgi Ring Burn).png` only as the anatomical reference for the narrow burn pattern visible in Quads C and D; ignore its lettering, crop, pose, setting, and modern clothing.\n\nCHARACTER AND PERIOD — Set every quad within 1901–1922, Constantinople in the Ottoman Empire. Rashid and Sofia are ageless vampires. Michael appears only inside Sofia’s ancestral blood memory in Quads A and B. Michael is an ancient vampire Blood God whose Presence feels physically dangerous to behold: serene and effortless rather than angry, his living youthful body nearly erased by cold moon-white radiance. Every real-world scene is at night or inside a sealed sunless ritual chamber. Architecture, clothing, weapons, manuscripts, transport, institutions, and religious practice suit the specific decade and geography.\n\nMICHAEL’S VISUAL LANGUAGE — Michael is barely older in appearance than a beautiful mortal youth. His face is living and boyish rather than statue-like: smooth alabaster-pale bloodless skin, delicate youthful jaw, flowing pale-gold-to-silver-blond hair, refined fangs visible only where his lips part, and a guileless expression that contrasts with his incomprehensible power. His graceful athletic torso is bare. A narrow translucent blood-red wrap crosses one shoulder and streams around his waist; it is the sole saturated color on him. Cold actinic white, silver-blue, and faint ultraviolet moonlight burns white holes through the image, erases portions of his hair and body contour, and creates immense eclipse rings, spectral crescents, radial coronas, retinal ghosts, violent lens bloom, and silver mist. His eyes blaze solid white-blue with no visible pupils. He has no literal wings; wing-like afterimages are made only from radiance.\n\nUR-SHULGI’S PROMISE AND BLOOD SORCERY — The ring has not yet burned Rashid during his encounter with Michael. In Quads A and B, both of Rashid’s hands, every finger, and the skin surrounding the ring are completely ordinary and unburned; red ritual light may reflect across the skin but must not resemble charring, soot, blackened flesh, or a spreading burn. In Quads C and D, the ring-bearing finger alone is fully blackened from fingertip through its base. From that finger, a narrow branching burn is fanning only a short distance across the back of his hand, leaving the other fingers, palm, wrist, and most of the hand normal. It is a localized supernatural scar, never a black glove or a fully burned hand. Rashid’s Blood Sorcery appears as disciplined deep-red geometric skeins and incomplete calligraphic structures without readable words. In Quads A and B, one unbroken visible path is travelling from Sofia beneath Rashid’s hand on her forehead, along Rashid’s body and outstretched arm, and into the red-black rim of the blood-memory portal. Michael and ancient Constantinople exist inside that single coherent portal view. Keep the red connection visually distinct from Michael’s dominant white-blue lunar radiance.\n\nCAMERA AND STYLE — Cinematic gothic realism, painterly photographic detail, extreme high contrast, tactile living skin and fabric, deep black negative space, monumental sacred composition, and layered atmosphere. Describe only one camera-visible instant per quad. Give each featured figure one principal pose, a clear anatomical expression, and a simple explicit eyeline. Reserve a calm dark low-detail area in every quad for later overlay text. No montage within a quad, captions, labels, arrows, readable manuscripts, logos, extra borders, watermark, anachronisms, static lineup posing, or graphic gore.\n\nQUAD A — TOP LEFT\nInside a sealed, windowless Nephilim ritual chamber, Sofia Mavridi is reclining rigidly in a carved chair in the left foreground, both eyes open and fixed beyond the room. Rashid is standing immediately beside her with one completely normal, unburned hand pressed flat to her forehead and his other completely normal, unburned hand extended toward an enormous circular red-black blood-memory portal occupying most of the background. Preserve the exact Panel A composition, poses, sightlines, scale, portal view, and figure placement from the attached modified sampler. Rashid’s face is turned toward the portal; his eyes are fixed on Michael with brows raised and lips parted in stunned alarm. A single current of disciplined red geometry is travelling from Sofia beneath Rashid’s hand, along his torso and extended arm, and into the portal rim.\n\nInside the portal, Michael is descending vertically above moonlit Constantinople with both arms lowered loosely beside his body, both hands below his hips, elbows relaxed, and fingers hanging toward the ground. His head is thrown fully backward, exposing his chin and throat; his face and blazing eyes are aimed vertically upward at the enormous eclipsed moon. His chest is leading the descent and the low perspective is strongly foreshortening his body, as though the viewer is directly beneath him watching him lower out of the sky. His bare alabaster torso, youthful innocent face, narrow streaming blood-red drape, and white lower fabric remain readable while his body is nearly consumed by a vertical pillar of actinic white-blue moonlight. Vast concentric lunar coronas dwarf him. The camera remains low beside Sofia’s chair so Sofia, Rashid’s two unburned hands, the connecting red geometry, and the enormous upward-looking portal form one clear diagonal.\n\nQUAD B — TOP RIGHT\nIn the same sealed ritual chamber after the connection has become violently intense, preserve Rashid’s pose, body orientation, outstretched arm, and eyeline exactly as shown in Panel B of the attached modified sampler. Sofia Mavridi is twisting rigidly in the carved chair at screen-left, her eyes squeezed shut, eyebrows knotted, jaw open, and neck muscles taut with visible pain. Rashid is braced beside her with one completely normal, unburned hand still pressed firmly to her forehead and his other completely normal, unburned hand thrust toward the portal. Rashid’s head and eyes remain turned squarely toward Michael, his teeth clenched and shoulders straining. A coherent stream of deep-red calligraphic geometry is travelling from Sofia beneath Rashid’s grip, through Rashid, and into the portal rim.\n\nInside the portal at screen-right, Michael is shown knees-up against radiant ancient Constantinople. His head and face are turning approximately twenty degrees toward screen-left and slightly downward. His blazing pupil-less eyes are locking directly onto Rashid’s visible face at screen-left; Michael and Rashid are making unmistakable mutual eye contact. Michael’s nearer arm is extending diagonally toward screen-left, directly toward Rashid rather than toward the camera or the centre of the quad. His nearer hand is open with the palm presented toward Rashid, palm slightly upward, fingers relaxed and gently separated in a clear reaching gesture. His index finger is not isolated into a pointing gesture. His other arm is relaxed. Michael’s youthful face remains serene and almost innocently compassionate while overwhelming white-blue radiance is erasing parts of his shoulders, hair, and waist. Preserve the dramatic low over-the-shoulder framing from close behind Rashid’s extended arm while keeping Sofia’s agonized face, Rashid’s forehead grip, the mutual eyeline, and Michael’s open palm readable in one frozen composition.\n\nQUAD C — BOTTOM LEFT\nAt night during World War I, Rashid is standing at a library telegraph desk and is holding one censored telegram under a red inspection seal, his eyes fixed on the missing line. The ring-bearing finger holding the telegram is fully blackened from fingertip through its base, and a narrow branching burn is fanning only a short distance from that finger across the back of his hand; the other fingers, palm, wrist, and most of the hand remain normal. Sofia is positioned at an open inner doorway, directing a column of refugees toward cots and food stores with one raised arm. Couriers and wounded soldiers fill the hall while military police silhouettes approach outside blackout curtains. Telephones, period uniforms, electric lamps, and sealed occult cabinets frame practical wartime responsibility. Use a high three-quarter camera over the telegram desk.\n\nQUAD D — BOTTOM RIGHT\nAt night under Allied occupation, Rashid is standing before a wall of pinned correspondence and is removing one severed route thread with his ring-bearing hand. That finger alone is fully blackened from fingertip through its base; a narrow branching burn is fanning only a short distance across the back of the hand, leaving the other fingers, palm, wrist, and most of the hand normal. Sofia is beside him pointing to a final European destination on a map without readable text, her expression grave. Rashid is looking at the empty place where Laleh’s trail ends. Foreign soldiers search the lamp-lit street below the shuttered window. Travel papers, a packed case, and a sealed ritual chamber door make departure imminent. Use an over-the-shoulder camera from behind Sofia.",
