    splashText = "COMMON INSTRUCTIONS\nCreate one textless 1920x1080 Memoriam splash concept sampler for Rashid-26, divided into four exactly equal 16:9 quads in a clean 2x2 grid: A top-left, B top-right, C bottom-left, D bottom-right. Use a narrow neutral-black cross-shaped gutter. Each quad is one independent frozen instant; figures, architecture, smoke, and lighting remain inside that quad.\n\nREFERENCE INPUTS — Attach every named file as an actual generation input. Use `assets/references/style-references/general-style-reference-contact-sheet.png` only for cinematic gothic-noir realism, near-monochrome black and charcoal, hard contrast, deep negative space, wet or metallic highlights, layered atmosphere, dynamic composition, and restrained blood-red accents; do not borrow its subjects or locations. Use `assets/references/pc-character-references/Rashid Abdulrahman [Cutout].webp` as Rashid’s exact identity reference.  Preserve each named figure’s face, apparent age, build, complexion, hair, and distinguishing features while adapting clothing and grooming to 2013. Character identity references override the style reference.\n\nCHARACTER AND PERIOD — Set every quad within 2013, Odense, Denmark. Rashid is an ageless Banu Haqim vampire serving as a disciplined mediator. The gathering is Camarilla: delegates are regal, elegant creatures of the night with deathly pallor, bold individual wardrobes, old-fashioned or avant-garde details, and restrained predatory bearing—not ordinary corporate executives. A few Nosferatu and other visibly inhuman vampires may attend. Every scene is night or inside a windowless conference space.  Architecture, clothing, weapons, manuscripts, transport, institutions, and religious practice must suit the specific decade and geography.\n\nSUPERNATURAL LANGUAGE — Ur-Shulgi’s Promise is a blackened ring and finger on Rashid’s hand, glowing restrained deep red only under supernatural pressure. Blood Sorcery appears as disciplined geometric skeins, incomplete calligraphic structures without readable words, or seals of deep-red light. Ancestral blood memory appears as one coherent scene inside a red-black threshold, never purple smoke or generic fantasy beams.\n\nCAMERA AND STYLE — Describe only one camera-visible instant per quad. Give each featured figure one principal pose, a clear expression, and a simple readable eyeline. Explore useful low, high, over-the-shoulder, or architectural viewpoints without obscuring anatomy. Reserve a calm dark low-detail area in every quad for later overlay text. No montage within a quad, captions, labels, readable manuscripts, logos, extra borders, watermark, anachronisms, static lineup posing, or graphic gore.\n\nQUAD A — TOP LEFT\nOutside a contemporary Odense hotel conference venue in cold rain at night, Rashid is standing beneath the entrance canopy and is holding two visibly identical credential cards side by side beneath a red security lamp. His brows are knitted and his eyes are fixed on the duplicate seals. Behind him, pale vampire delegates in bold velvet, severe antique tailoring, sculptural coats, and jewel-toned evening wear are moving toward two guarded entrances; one aristocratic woman shows subtly lengthened fangs while speaking. Wet bicycles, historic façades, modern glass, and black sky establish Odense. Use a close low angle from credential height.\n\nQUAD B — TOP RIGHT\nAt the central negotiation table inside a windowless hall, Rashid is rotating one draft document toward the shared center with his blackened ringed hand while his other palm rests firmly on a sheathed ceremonial dagger, keeping it off the bargaining space. He is looking directly at a pale elder in embroidered formalwear across from him. Around the table sit regal vampires with deathly pallor and distinct historical fashions, including one unmistakable Nosferatu with deformed features in impeccable evening clothes and one Banu Haqim delegate in austere dark robes. Their postures are predatory and restrained, not corporate. Use a low table-level camera.\n\nQUAD C — BOTTOM LEFT\nIn a dim hotel corridor during the night recess, Rashid is holding one contradictory credential beneath a wall security light while a young pale observer stands at the closed end of the corridor. Rashid’s eyes are fixed on the card, his expression precise and suspicious; his free hand rests on the door control that has sealed the exit. The observer’s face is partly hidden by a raised collar and deep shadow, body poised but still. Two vampire security officers in distinctive dark formalwear wait behind Rashid. Use a restrained Dutch angle from beside the locked door.\n\nQUAD D — BOTTOM RIGHT\nIn a rain-dark university courtyard after the pact, Rashid is closing one red-lit document case while speaking into a secure phone, his eyes turned toward an empty place in the departing procession. In the background, pale Camarilla negotiators in velvet coats, antique military tailoring, dramatic capes, couture evening wear, and severe jewelry are exchanging guarded handshakes beneath umbrellas; one discreet Nosferatu is visible among them. Their bearing is regal, nocturnal, and predatory rather than corporate. Escort cars, secure document cases, bicycles, wet stone, and black sky frame the exhausting practical aftermath. Use a high three-quarter view from an arcade.",
